# Consumed by the `devenv <cmd>` shell function, which runs
# `op run --account <shorthand> --env-file=<this file> -- <cmd>`.
#
# Bootstrap installs this template twice, one file per 1Password account:
#   secrets.env          -> personal   devenv <cmd>
#   secrets.work.env  -> work    OP_ACCOUNT=work devenv <cmd>
# Keep each file's references inside its own account; `op run` resolves against
# one account per call.
#
# Every value must be an `op://<vault>/<item>/<field>` reference; `op run` fails
# the whole command on an unresolvable one, so add lines only for items that
# exist. Requires an active session: eval "$(op signin --account <shorthand>)".

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=op://Private/anthropic/credential
# OPENAI_API_KEY=op://Private/openai/credential
# GEMINI_API_KEY=op://Private/gemini/credential
